<div class="container prose">
  <p>A general home inspection catches surface issues, but plumbing pros spot supply age, risky polybutylene, water heater venting, and subtle leak evidence before you commit to a property or plan a major project. We deliver clear notes you can share with agents, sellers, or tenants.</p>
  <h2>What we review</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Visible supply and drain piping, cleanouts, and hoses</li>
    <li>Water heater condition, T&amp;P, and installation details</li>
    <li>Fixture operation, pressure, and drainage timing</li>
    <li>Optional camera add-on for main sewer lines</li>
  </ul>
